  "idea": "Excalidraw: virtual whiteboard for brainstorming and architecture diagrams",
  "text": "Stop paying for Miro or Lucidchart when this free tool does ninety percent of the job. Teams waste hundreds yearly on bloated software just to sketch basic user flows and system architectures. Those platforms restrict free board counts and lock your diagrams behind proprietary file formats. Excalidraw offers an open-source whiteboard featuring real-time encrypted collaboration and instant vector exports. You eliminate software costs while speeding up planning.",
